WEBVTT

00:09:59.287 --> 00:10:03.287
and I'm finally getting a chance to
record this voice memo for you,

00:10:03.912 --> 00:10:08.829
you asked me to catch you
up on what feels like

00:10:08.829 --> 00:10:15.037
an absolute lifetime since we talked,
everybody questioning everything,

00:10:15.496 --> 00:10:19.871
rightly so, about what it means
to live in this country,

00:10:19.871 --> 00:10:21.787
what it means to be a student,

00:10:21.787 --> 00:10:26.954
what it means to be a person of faith
or an atheist or a humanist,

00:10:26.954 --> 00:10:31.871
or what it means to be a chaplain or
a critic of the tech industry.